Subject: theme: a --shadow-thumb token

What: theme.css adds --shadow-thumb: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18).
Why: the app's effort picker thumb takes its shadow from a theme token, not a literal.

diff --git a/src/styles/theme.css b/src/styles/theme.css
index fddba71a38b49574b92dc7290048e39cde744bbd..7b44ac5a2fce63cb112e7bf31273c33c4e05068f 100644
--- a/src/styles/theme.css
+++ b/src/styles/theme.css
@@ -140,6 +140,7 @@
   --radius-5xl: 1.125rem;
   --radius-pill: 9999px;
 
+  --shadow-thumb: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18);
   --shadow-xs:
     0 1px 2px -0.5px light-dark(hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.04), hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.06)),
     0 0.5px 1.5px 0 light-dark(hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.025), hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.08)),
